e result is pending, use get_site to observe the current slug; do not call this mutation again to\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__sites_create_schedule\",\"description\":\"Create and link a cloud task for a published Site when the user has requested scheduling. Before creating a new schedule, read get_site. If automations is missing or null\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__sites_create_site\",\"description\":\"Create a site only when .openai/hosting.json has no project_id. If it has one, reuse that site. Never call this tool more than once for the same local site. This tool doe\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__sites_create_source_repository_write_credential\",\"description\":\"Create a short-lived source repository write credential when the credential returned by create_site is missing or no longer usable. It authorizes Git pushes to the site's\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__sites_deploy_private_site_version\",\"description\":\"Deploy a saved site version to production for a site created in the current flow whose owner-only access has not changed, or an existing site already known to be owner-pr\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__sites_deploy_site_version\",\"description\":\"Deploy a saved site version to production when the site is shared, public, cannot be verified as owner-only, or private deployment is unavailable. For existing sites not \"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__sites_generate_siwc_bypass_token\",\"description\":\"Generate a bearer token for identity-less API requests that bypasses a site's Sign in with ChatGPT gate. Call this explicit token tool only when the user asks for a bypas\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__sites_get_deployment_status\",\"description\":\"Get the current status of a production deployment. Only poll when a deployment ID is available; the deployment owns its saved version, so do not supply version_id. Contin\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__sites_get_environment_variables\",\"description\":\"Get the production runtime environment variables